      "reviews": "“The game evokes the frantic action of Nidhogg, but with the more down-to-earth grit and ‘realistic’ combat of For Honor and Mordhau. And it’s great fun”<br>PC Invasion<br><br>“As tactical as a duel between medieval knights, or as simple as rock/paper/scissors with claymores &amp; dismemberment. Either way it’s fun.”<br>4/5 – Otaku Gamers UK<br><br>“There’s a lot to love when it comes to Griefhelm”<br>9/10 – Indie Game Website<br>",
